  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project constitutes the development, construction, operation, and transfer of a 250 MW solar PV along with a 63 MW/126MWh of battery storage and a 220 kV substation. The project site is in the Bukhara region and covers an area of around 6.75 square kilometers.</narrative>
